      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've wanted a feature like this for a long time! \n\nI think it would allow for a much more optimized use of audio in avatars. I can imagine creating a sort of 'audio atlas' of music and effects, so various animations could start and stop a specified points throughout the file. This way you would only need to upload one sound file that contains all of the audio for the entirety of your avatar, and code would determine where to jump around the file as needed",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
